/**
 * Extract human-readable decision rules from a trained mlcart decision-tree object.
 *
 * Compatible with common CART tree shapes used in JS libraries (including mlcart).
 * Tries to inspect node fields flexibly: feature/attribute/col, threshold/splitValue/value,
