 * Finds the roots of two coupled nonlinear equations using the Levenberg-Marquardt algorithm
 * @param {Function} equations - Function that takes [x, y] and returns [f1(x,y), f2(x,y)]
 * @param {Array} initialGuess - Initial estimate [x0, y0]
 * @param {Object} options - Optional configuration object
